# Pre-registration integrity record
# SHA-256 of PREREG.md (locked methodology + the within-tissue test (10), the powered closed-loop
# comparison (11), and the multi-agent panel ablation (12)). Recompute: sha256sum PREREG.md.
#
# LINE ENDINGS ARE PART OF THE HASH. PREREG.md is pinned to LF via .gitattributes so this value
# reproduces on every platform. Before 2026-08-03 the recorded value was the CRLF digest
# 98b7cce2880623c7da24213d7c2ee201a91093d114bc5b02d0fd8612dbaaea2f, which only a Windows checkout
# could reproduce; a Linux or macOS clone computed the value below and saw a mismatch. The document
# was never edited. The two byte streams are identical after normalising line endings, which anyone
# can confirm by converting either way and re-hashing. Only the representation changed, and with it
# the digest.
PREREG.md  ad77f0655e342eb79c2f844a5a025d3769d98959655038a1e03fc550936de69d
